WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.209 --> 00:00:01.001
(Gunshot)

00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:07.174
♪♪

00:00:07.174 --> 00:00:08.634
Dad, what did you do?

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:09.801
♪♪

00:00:09.801 --> 00:00:12.304
-I, um...
-Allie: Shh, hey.

00:00:12.304 --> 00:00:15.724
Around about the early mid-point
of this first season

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:19.853
Neil:
we begin to see the first hints
that there is more to Margot 

00:00:19.853 --> 00:00:21.063
Neil:
than meets the eye.

00:00:21.063 --> 00:00:23.357
She's not a passenger in this
story.

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:24.358
♪♪

00:00:24.358 --> 00:00:27.319
What did you tell Chuy,
about us?

00:00:27.319 --> 00:00:31.406
Mosquito Coast came to me and I
just kept the script by my
bedside,

00:00:31.406 --> 00:00:33.200
Melissa:
and read it over the months.

00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.326
Melissa:
And never did a casting.

00:00:34.326 --> 00:00:36.370
Melissa:
Because I was afraid that I
loved it too much,

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:38.538
Melissa:
that I didn't want to lose the
part.

00:00:38.538 --> 00:00:41.208
So here's what's gonna happen.

00:00:41.208 --> 00:00:43.335
Melissa:
Margot's got this killer streak
in her,

00:00:43.335 --> 00:00:45.796
and what I wanted to show in
episode 4 especially is that

00:00:45.796 --> 00:00:50.133
Melissa:
you can see that when things are
bad, she's like an assassin.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:53.470
Melissa:
A very elegant, silent one.

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:56.431
I've always considered her the
patriarch of the family.

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:58.767
Justin:
She's the one who's probably the
most level,

00:00:58.767 --> 00:01:01.520
Justin:
the most thoughtful and also the
most empathetic

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:02.479
Justin:
with the children.

00:01:02.479 --> 00:01:03.563
I'm a mom.

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:07.734
Always thinking about the worst
thing that could possibly happen
to them.

00:01:07.734 --> 00:01:10.904
Justin:
Allie is sort of this slightly
hyperactive 

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:11.989
Justin:
bouncy child.

00:01:11.989 --> 00:01:15.284
He's incredibly facile at
manipulating people

00:01:15.284 --> 00:01:17.786
Justin:
as he's looking them in the
eye and being dead honest with them.

00:01:17.786 --> 00:01:20.455
Hey, I told you it was gonna be
an adventure.

00:01:20.455 --> 00:01:25.752
Allie exemplifies an element of
the American dream.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:30.215
Neil:
Wherein that hurricane of
optimism and a forward movement

00:01:30.215 --> 00:01:31.925
Neil:
becomes a kind of blindness

00:01:31.925 --> 00:01:35.053
Neil:
to the needs of what might be
around.

00:01:35.053 --> 00:01:38.682
He's always thinking that the
grass is greener, because to him
it is.

00:01:38.682 --> 00:01:41.268
And he constantly searches for
that part of life.

00:01:41.268 --> 00:01:45.188
Neil:
In episode 4, Allie's confronted
with some truths about himself,

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:47.566
Neil:
and is humiliated.

00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:52.237
Which is an element, Justin
didn't only accept, but
celebrate and pushed.

00:01:52.237 --> 00:01:54.281
You wanna run away from
America, but you can't.

00:01:54.281 --> 00:01:57.826
Chuy:
The way you think you can buy
people, the way you think you can buy anything you want.

00:01:57.826 --> 00:01:59.202
You are America.

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:03.290
He's got this very
American, pioneer spirit, um,
we're just gonna set off

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:06.835
Justin:
and we're gonna find our
Shangri-La elsewhere.

00:02:06.835 --> 00:02:11.298
Neil:
There's a tension between
optimism and theft.

00:02:11.298 --> 00:02:15.469
In this constant need, always to
look at the next valley.

00:02:15.469 --> 00:02:17.220
Neil:
There's always the next place to
go.

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.764
Neil:
It's always gonna be better.

00:02:18.764 --> 00:02:22.976
♪♪

